<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom dips from early high.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom dips from early high.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom hit a record high of 6,650 escudos, compared with its 6,545 previous close, after announcing on Wednesday a 51.5 percent rise in net profit for 1996 to 54.9 billion escudos.</p>
<p>But the stock was dipping back under 6,600 to 6,570 in later trade on profit-taking.</p>
<p>Dealers said that the profit figures, while good, were in line with some of the more optimistic forecasts. The stock had already risen sharply this week.</p>
<p>($1=171.3 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
